186:
Each licensee shall comply with all applicable rules, regulations, laws and statutes of the state, and all local ordinances, and shall, in addition thereto or in furtherance thereof:
(1) Prohibit the sale or serving of alcoholic beverages in automobiles or other vehicles, or anywhere outside of the main building or accessory thereto in which the business of such licensee is operated, except as provided for in section 4-3(e);
